{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act32side_level_act32side_04_end",
  "groupId": "act32side",
  "stageId": "act32side_04",
  "title": "非傳統藝術空間",
  "storyCode": "CR-4",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_04_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "83a6f4a6d0cfe8dd939a304f545ea6de0be3dda22b69793266e092b7a94adebb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "看來特克諾已經穿戴好安全設備了，看她抓耳朵的樣子，根本不像是準備好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "現在下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "稍等，等她下降到既定位置，我可不想在速降過程中發生衝撞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸欸欸，慢點慢點，我掉得太快了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "這也算快嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "她就像片小羽毛，緩緩落下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "……現在可不是笑到肚子痛的好時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "她到位置了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "一切就緒，你也可以動身了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "扯扯手中的安全繩，ELA側身翻出窗戶，將腳尖抵在牆上，努力讓懸空的身體在風中保持住平衡。\n等了一下子，風漸漸停下，她鬆開一隻抓住繩子的手，將被風吹歪的帽子戴正，向屋內的FUZE露出微笑。\n隨後，她將另一隻手也鬆開，消失在窗外，只留下一段繩索掛在窗沿快速滑動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "嗯……不錯，看來她們是成功會晤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "哇啊啊啊——！你怎麼也跳下來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "別吵，專注點，剛才你差點就要剪斷一條主操作線了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "那些跟著你的人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "甩掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "老爹難道沒有警告過你不要到處亂走嗎……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "嗯，說了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "那你還跟過來幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "確保你不會搞砸這項工程。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "你這人……你知道該怎麼辦嗎，就這麼講我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "那你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "呃……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "下降時我簡單檢查了一下木偶手臂上的控制元件，是液壓驅動的問題，把你的工具給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他們就在上面，快點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要不是底下那個女人攔著，早就逮捕他們了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "嚯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "看起來之後都是我的麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作業人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "領隊！好消息，繩索交纏的地方解開了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "這麼快？那趕快把特克諾拉上來，我們繼續組裝木偶的手臂與身體。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作業人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "她說她要繼續留在那裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "我說我要繼續待在這裡！我會在這裡輔助安裝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "啊，你願意幫忙當然很好，可你能保證不會影響到旁邊的ELA女士嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "你再說一次？我等一下上去要一拳揍歪你的鼻子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "咳咳，ELA小姐，為了我的鼻子著想，你能讓她繼續留在那裡嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "當然可以，特克諾小姐是個講義氣的朋友，不願意讓我一個人面對高空作業的危險。除了感激，我還能說什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1212_1",
      "text": "咳、咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "看，木偶的手臂重新開始移動了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "在那裡吊著的人是特克諾……怎麼還有另外一個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "那是誰？工程師，技師，還是特克諾的助手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "助手，你確定？特克諾一向不喜歡有人參與到她的設計中來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "我再看看……不行，視線被擋住了。欸，朋友，你能認出來嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "在問我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "對，你站在那邊仰頭看了好一下子了。你能看清特克諾旁邊的人是誰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "你問ELA？事情有點複雜——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "驚訝的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_416_1",
      "text": "唔，是我看錯了嗎？這傢伙居然拍了拍特克諾的腦袋……上次這麼做的人差點被她咬掉一根手指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "呃，所以你們就當她是特克諾的……朋友吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "可惡，你這傢伙溜得還挺快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "唔……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "哼，是條漢子，挨了我這一拳還能不聲不響的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "快點把路讓開，你也不想今天就交待在這裡吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "啊啊啊——！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "特克諾，堅持住，我們馬上就來，那女人休想動你一根汗毛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "把手拿開！你這女人想要幹什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "你這傢伙快給我從窗戶邊閃開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "特克諾，你還好嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "你、你怎麼在上面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "老爹派我來盯著那些外來的傢伙，我聽到你的慘叫了，那女人對你做了什麼？！我這就爬下來幫你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "呃，沒、沒事，我挺好的，就是……就是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "我剛剛拍了她的腦袋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "力道很重？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "沒有……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "……那你喊什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "我……呃，那個總之我沒事，你們回去告訴老爹，讓他放心，我看著這女人，不會出事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "特克諾，把焊接工具遞給我，謝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特克諾",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "給，在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區守衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1215_1",
      "text": "（小聲）這丫頭居然甘心當人助手……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "老兄，既然她兩能合作得親密無間，你還有什麼疑問嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作業人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "木偶已經組裝完成了，領隊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "呼……準備好了嗎？朋友們，我們來到最難的一關了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "給她們心跳，給她們血液，給她們活力，給她們生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作業人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "我已經準備很久了，領隊，請下達命令吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "各位，歷經大半年的付出與努力，我們最終還是克服種種困難來到了這一天，感激大家的堅持……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "各部門請聽好，第一次起舞測驗準備開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "來吧，女孩們，眨眨眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "……她們醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "我曾經無數次地想像過這個畫面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "傳單上，每個人的講述中，草稿圖紙上……這很難實現，所以我接受她們與我的想像有出入，我接受她們無法滿足我的幻想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "現在呢？你親眼見到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "我只能說……這一切遠超我的想像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看著那兩個正在不停眨眼的巨大木偶，IANA再次被她們的美麗面容與精細構造震撼到了。\n一動不動坐在那裡時，她們是兩件漂亮的藝術品，但當她們動起來，就是這裡最美麗的兩個女孩。\n她們濃密的睫毛抬起來，然後迅速垂下去，擋住了眼睛，IANA幾次嘗試去看也沒能看到。\n突然，她們中的一個低下頭轉向IANA，低垂的睫毛抬起後再沒有落下來，目光對上IANA的視線。\n那是一雙橙紅色的瞳孔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "她的眼睛為什麼是橙紅色？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "那是朝陽倒映在她眼中的顏色，她會在陽光下盡情舞蹈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "哦，是陽光將它染成了橙紅色……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "社區居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_242",
      "text": "原本我們想做一對黑色的眼珠，你懂，全塗黑很省事。但是特克諾不願意，她覺得黑色是最不受陽光青睞的顏色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "……不，她說錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "IANA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4124_iana_1",
      "text": "陽光不會青睞的顏色其實是白色。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在掌聲與歡呼聲中，木偶開始伸展自己的四肢，每個關節的活動，都需要一群人拼盡全力，嘶吼著拉扯牽繩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "我數一，二，三！拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作業人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "呃啊————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "木偶抬起膝蓋，向前邁出一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "好，諸位，一，二，三，放！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作業人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "咦呀————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "木偶揮動手臂，輕輕擦過身側。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "指揮人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1274_1",
      "text": "好，一，二，三，再來一次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作業人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_001",
      "text": "嗬啊————————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沿著圍觀者讓開的道路，她們以輕快的步伐穿過居民樓，偶爾矮下身通過兩棟樓之間的連廊。\n最後她們停在了社區的中央廣場上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "一，二，三！呃啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "謝了，朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "你要換個地方欣賞這場表演嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "不用了，這個窗戶的觀景效果不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "讓我看看時間，嗯，差不多快到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天色逐漸暗沉，雙月漸漸從城市的遠端升起，月光將水泥地照得像冬日結冰的湖面。\n兩位木偶舞者在地面上旋轉，隨著響板的節奏聲，她們的身體或繃直，或蜷曲，每一寸曲線都在月光下盡情展示。\n從高樓中，屋簷下，小巷裡，還有幾扇昏暗的窗戶間，樂聲傾瀉而出。\n這是一場即興的合奏，沒有排演，沒有指揮。\n樂聲只是隨著木偶舞者的舞步肆意地流淌。\n而舞者挪移間飛起的裙擺也在不停捕捉著流至她們腳下的音符，並將其轉換為美妙的舞動。\n高大的木偶低下頭顱，注視著那些在她們腳邊的人。\n那些如同羽粉一般輕盈細小的人，跟著她們的舞步。\n在空氣中跳躍，然後落地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "你現在還覺得我不理智嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "（搖頭）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "很值得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "FUZE",
      "speakerId": "avg_4126_fuze_1",
      "text": "你早就預見到了這樣的場景對嗎？所以才願意盡心去幫他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ELA",
      "speakerId": "avg_4123_ela_1",
      "text": "不，我從來沒有那樣預先設想過，那不是樂趣所在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "唔，真棒，是誰教你吹口琴的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "是媽媽，媽媽什麼都會，會吹口琴，會跳舞，會畫畫，還會烤很好吃的可頌麵包。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "我最喜歡媽媽了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "雖然很敬佩那位無所不能的女士，但我還是要說，應該唸Croissant！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稚嫩的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_240",
      "text": "……Quaso？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龍舌蘭",
      "speakerId": "avg_486_espumo_1",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "呼……算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "DOC",
      "speakerId": "avg_4125_rdoc_1",
      "text": "……我得來杯咖啡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修復師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "text": "雷內爾先生，我仔細檢查了一番音樂盒，徹底修復需要花費幾週的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修復師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "text": "但目前，我先按照夾層內的樂譜重製了一小部分音筒，您要試聽一下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一段悠揚的音樂從盒中傾瀉而出，將雷內爾的回憶帶到十多年前的午後，他貼在門後，偷聽從母親工坊裡傳出的叮噹聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修復師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "text": "光憑這一小段修復的曲子推測，應該是一首搖籃曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "text": "……很樸實的曲子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修復師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "text": "嗯，所以初次聽到時我覺得很驚訝，我記得在以往的作品中，您母親使用的旋律往往是精美的名家之作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "text": "因為這首曲子是她自己寫的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "text": "……她不是專業的作曲家，只是作為一個母親，為她的孩子寫下了這首並不出彩的搖籃曲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "text": "沒有什麼特別之處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修復師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "text": "但至少對於那個孩子來說，它是特別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修復師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "text": "雷內爾先生……您一直盯著窗外，那裡有什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷內爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1211_1",
      "text": "沒什麼，只是月亮升起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
